{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0354-s001", "text": "Våld är ett brott i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T075926092444Z/hb-c09-u0354-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.995374149659864, "peak": 0.28436279296875, "generation_seconds": 13.669989065034315, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0354-s002", "text": "Trots det förekommer det våld i en del familjer.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T075926092444Z/hb-c09-u0354-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.388571428571429, "peak": 0.261993408203125, "generation_seconds": 16.22487089992501, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0354-s003", "text": "Med våld i nära relationer avses våld där förövaren och offret har en nära relation till varandra.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T075926092444Z/hb-c09-u0354-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.70748299319728, "peak": 0.2781982421875, "generation_seconds": 34.451989457942545, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0354-s004", "text": "Offret är maken, partnern, den tidigare maken, ett barn, ett syskon, en släkting eller någon annan närstående.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T075926092444Z/hb-c09-u0354-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.404081632653062, "peak": 0.260345458984375, "generation_seconds": 42.49066218594089, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0419-s001", "text": "Våld i nära relationer är våld som sker inom familjen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T075926092444Z/hb-c09-u0419-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.154829931972789, "peak": 0.238037109375, "generation_seconds": 19.816208695992827, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0420-s001", "text": "Det påverkar alla familjemedlemmar, inte bara den som utsätts för våldet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T075926092444Z/hb-c09-u0420-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.339047619047619, "peak": 0.40545654296875, "generation_seconds": 23.870445695938542, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0355-s001", "text": "Fysiskt våld är ofta lätt att känna igen som våld.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T075926092444Z/hb-c09-u0355-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.806530612244898, "peak": 0.240386962890625, "generation_seconds": 16.340326219098642, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0355-s002", "text": "Det kan vara till exempel slag, knuffar eller slag med föremål.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T075926092444Z/hb-c09-u0355-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.642448979591837, "peak": 0.262176513671875, "generation_seconds": 21.993959947954863, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0355-s003", "text": "Psykiskt våld är också våld.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T080311977756Z/hb-c09-u0355-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.0650340136054424, "peak": 0.30419921875, "generation_seconds": 13.347060106927529, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0355-s004", "text": "Det kan vara att förövaren till exempel skäller på och förödmjukar offret, övervakar vad hen gör eller begränsar hens sociala relationer.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T080311977756Z/hb-c09-u0355-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.563537414965987, "peak": 0.310211181640625, "generation_seconds": 34.41709292307496, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0356-s001", "text": "Våld kan också vara ekonomiskt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T080311977756Z/hb-c09-u0356-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.274013605442177, "peak": 0.29473876953125, "generation_seconds": 11.78363520395942, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0356-s002", "text": "Ekonomiskt våld kan vara till exempel att den ena maken på egen hand fattar alla ekonomiska beslut i familjen eller att den andra inte har tillgång till några egna pengar alls.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T080311977756Z/hb-c09-u0356-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 14.489251700680272, "peak": 0.476287841796875, "generation_seconds": 47.38248513592407, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0356-s003", "text": "Att pressa eller tvinga någon till sex i sin tur är sexuellt våld.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T080311977756Z/hb-c09-u0356-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.130068027210885, "peak": 0.327484130859375, "generation_seconds": 24.167578380089253, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0356-s004", "text": "Sex utan samtycke är ett brott också när offret och förövaren är gifta med varandra.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T080311977756Z/hb-c09-u0356-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.523265306122449, "peak": 0.3719482421875, "generation_seconds": 20.61794009618461, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0357-s001", "text": "Typiskt för våld i nära relationer är att det först börjar med psykiskt våld, det vill säga med till exempel ett kontrollerande beteende.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T080311977756Z/hb-c09-u0357-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.633197278911565, "peak": 0.263397216796875, "generation_seconds": 36.46839847788215, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0357-s002", "text": "Med tiden blir våldet ofta allvarligare och börjar inkludera också fysiskt våld.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T080311977756Z/hb-c09-u0357-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.035646258503402, "peak": 0.31298828125, "generation_seconds": 21.288682143203914, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0358-s001", "text": "Om det förekommer våld i familjen är det viktigt att anmäla det till polisen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T080721045065Z/hb-c09-u0358-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.896326530612245, "peak": 0.391937255859375, "generation_seconds": 24.928604116896167, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0358-s002", "text": "Tyvärr anmäls endast en liten del av alla fall med våld i nära relationer till polisen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T080721045065Z/hb-c09-u0358-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.9412244897959186, "peak": 0.28436279296875, "generation_seconds": 30.036935987882316, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0358-s003", "text": "Folk tänker ofta att våld i familjen är en privatsak.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T080721045065Z/hb-c09-u0358-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.015510204081632, "peak": 0.30474853515625, "generation_seconds": 16.422314370051026, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0358-s004", "text": "Därför tiger de.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T080721045065Z/hb-c09-u0358-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.159455782312925, "peak": 0.407379150390625, "generation_seconds": 6.152154873823747, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0358-s005", "text": "Våld är ändå alltid en straffbar handling, även om den sker inom familjen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T080721045065Z/hb-c09-u0358-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.617687074829932, "peak": 0.3656005859375, "generation_seconds": 19.606847553048283, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0359-s001", "text": "Att fysiskt aga och misshandla ett barn kan orsaka allvarliga skador, till och med dödsfall.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T080721045065Z/hb-c09-u0359-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.150204081632653, "peak": 0.3424072265625, "generation_seconds": 29.06124352896586, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0359-s002", "text": "Barnet kan få svåra trauman av det som skadar hens mentala och sociala utveckling.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T080721045065Z/hb-c09-u0359-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.314285714285714, "peak": 0.2745361328125, "generation_seconds": 26.315176493953913, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0359-s003", "text": "Om ett barn faller offer för våld, kan hen känna mycket hat och rädsla och förlora tilliten till vuxna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T080721045065Z/hb-c09-u0359-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.986122448979591, "peak": 0.262786865234375, "generation_seconds": 40.83160872804001, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0359-s004", "text": "Om barnet tar modell av en vuxen som beter sig våldsamt, kan det ge problem genom hela livet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T081115503422Z/hb-c09-u0359-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.080544217687075, "peak": 0.266387939453125, "generation_seconds": 35.807861018925905, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0360-s001", "text": "Om en förälder eller ett syskon utnyttjar ett barn sexuellt, är det fråga om särskilt allvarligt sexuellt våld och incest.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T081115503422Z/hb-c09-u0360-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.727619047619047, "peak": 0.36517333984375, "generation_seconds": 36.37122948584147, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0360-s002", "text": "Det orsakar allvarliga trauman och problem för barnets utveckling.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T081115503422Z/hb-c09-u0360-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.851428571428571, "peak": 0.477569580078125, "generation_seconds": 16.678375795017928, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0361-s001", "text": "Ett barn är aldrig skyldigt till det utnyttjande som hen utsätts för, utan ansvaret ligger alltid hos den vuxne.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T081115503422Z/hb-c09-u0361-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.404081632653062, "peak": 0.374542236328125, "generation_seconds": 24.34736237092875, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0361-s002", "text": "Det är särskilt svårt för barn att berätta om utnyttjande om förövaren är en familjemedlem.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T081115503422Z/hb-c09-u0361-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.150204081632653, "peak": 0.3009033203125, "generation_seconds": 21.049239960033447, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0361-s003", "text": "Övriga familjemedlemmar är skyldiga att ingripa om de misstänker att det förekommer utnyttjande inom familjen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T081115503422Z/hb-c09-u0361-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.613061224489796, "peak": 0.292633056640625, "generation_seconds": 21.78530442994088, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0362-s001", "text": "Användning av våld eller hot om våld påverkar alltid barnen, även om våldet inte skulle rikta sig mot dem.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T081115503422Z/hb-c09-u0362-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.986122448979591, "peak": 0.32354736328125, "generation_seconds": 20.408509794157, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0362-s002", "text": "Våld mellan föräldrarna ger direkta och indirekta psykiska konsekvenser för barnet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T081115503422Z/hb-c09-u0362-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.383945578231293, "peak": 0.2744140625, "generation_seconds": 13.650354562094435, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0362-s003", "text": "Redan en upplevelse av våld kan göra att känslan av trygghet försvinner och sätta livslånga spår i barnet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T081459505906Z/hb-c09-u0362-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.334421768707482, "peak": 0.304534912109375, "generation_seconds": 20.95589271490462, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0363-s001", "text": "Barn kan uppleva att till exempel våld mot mamman är mer skrämmande än våld som de själva utsätts för.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T081459505906Z/hb-c09-u0363-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.916462585034013, "peak": 0.274566650390625, "generation_seconds": 23.46081750304438, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0363-s002", "text": "Även om barnen inte skulle se våldet, kan de känna den spända stämningen i familjen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T081459505906Z/hb-c09-u0363-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.244625850340136, "peak": 0.26495361328125, "generation_seconds": 19.789294860791415, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0364-s001", "text": "Våld och rädsla för våld kan ge barnet ångest, glädjelöshet och sömnsvårigheter.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T081459505906Z/hb-c09-u0364-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.035646258503402, "peak": 0.28021240234375, "generation_seconds": 18.692625581054017, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0364-s002", "text": "Barnets fysiska och mentala hälsa och utveckling kan äventyras.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T081459505906Z/hb-c09-u0364-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.50312925170068, "peak": 0.31939697265625, "generation_seconds": 16.699785965960473, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0364-s003", "text": "Barn som upplevt våld har ofta inlärnings- och koncentrationssvårigheter i skolan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T081459505906Z/hb-c09-u0364-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.383945578231293, "peak": 0.255706787109375, "generation_seconds": 24.307976529933512, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0365-s001", "text": "Skyddsåldersgränsen för sexuellt umgänge är 16 år.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T081459505906Z/hb-c09-u0365-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.433469387755102, "peak": 0.23895263671875, "generation_seconds": 19.284270212054253, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0365-s002", "text": "Det betyder att sexuellt umgänge med ett barn under 16 år är ett brott.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T081459505906Z/hb-c09-u0365-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.617687074829932, "peak": 0.258514404296875, "generation_seconds": 21.160996188875288, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0365-s003", "text": "Ett sexuellt förhållande mellan ungdomar som befinner på samma stadium i utvecklingen är dock inte ett brott.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vald/narration-resume-20261103T081814276337Z/hb-c09-u0365-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.125442176870749, "peak": 0.319061279296875, "generation_seconds": 24.98389864899218, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
